  "question": {
    "text": "The reaction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HClO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math> gives a paramagnetic gas, which upon reaction with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;produces"
